Package: sieccwinter
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Winter Weather and Social-Outcome Analysis for the SIECC Study
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Nahum M.", "Gabinet", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "ngabinet@campus.haifa.ac.il",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5861-1507"))
Description: A clean, documented implementation of the SIECC Winter analytical workflow:
    cumulative-window regressions (seven model tiers, HC3 inference for continuous outcomes,
    logistic regression for high integration), the final L01-L56 distributed-lag models
    (linear exposure, natural cubic spline across lag with 3 df, nested-F and likelihood-ratio
    global tests, pointwise and simultaneous bands), Benjamini-Hochberg families, input
    validation and comparison with frozen aggregate reference outputs. The package contains
    no study data; a fully synthetic data set is provided for workflow demonstration only.
    Suggested packages are used only for optional cross-checks and tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ngngn1977-cloud/sieccwinter
BugReports: https://github.com/ngngn1977-cloud/sieccwinter/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
